{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50369","headline":"敦煌（伯五○○七）三首 □□（原卷此首诗题作《敦煌》。） · 敦煌人作品[一]","name":"敦煌（伯五○○七）三首 □□（原卷此首诗题作《敦煌》。）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"万顷平田四畔沙，汉朝城垒属蕃家。\n歌谣再复归唐国，道舞春风杨柳花。\n仕女上（尚）□天宝髻，水流依旧种桑麻。\n雄军往往施鼙鼓，鬬将徒劳猃狁夸。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"敦煌人作品[一]","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50369.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50369","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}